---
title: 09 - Meeting Questions Sequence Diagram
---
sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 participant UI as AskMeetingPanel
 participant API as FastAPI
 participant DB as JobStore
 participant Ask as AskMeeting
 participant L as Configured LLM endpoint
 UI->>API: POST /api/jobs/{id}/questions<br/>{question, expected_revision}
 API->>DB: result(job_id)
 DB-->>API: Edited turns and revision snapshot
 API->>API: Check question, revision and LLM configuration
 Note over API: Mismatched revision / disabled or incomplete LLM: HTTP 409
 API->>DB: Lookup request key<br/>(provider identity, question, revision, transcript hash)
 alt Valid cached answer
  DB-->>API: Current answer payload
 else No cached answer
  API->>Ask: answer(question, turns)
  Ask->>Ask: BM25 passages + adjacent turns / bound context
  alt No context retrieved
   Ask-->>API: not_found, empty answer_points
  else Context available
   loop Up to 2 JSON / ID attempts
    Ask->>L: Question and retrieved text with source IDs
    L-->>Ask: Completion JSON
    Ask->>Ask: Validate schema and retrieved source IDs
   end
   Ask->>Ask: Attach full source turns and needs_review flags
   Ask-->>API: found or not_found payload
  end
 end
 API->>DB: save_answer under BEGIN IMMEDIATE<br/>Check revision again / upsert request key
 alt Revision still matches
  DB-->>API: Saved answer with revision
  API-->>UI: HTTP 200 answer and sources
 else Transcript changed during request
  DB-->>API: RevisionConflict
  API-->>UI: HTTP 409 / reload and ask again
 end
 Note over API,L: Provider / answer errors: HTTP 502 generic message.<br/>Q&A runs in the API request, outside JobWorker.
